From 11cde1ad877d359692284bd641fc06599ebd5be0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 19:22:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 092/638] [AROS] Define Blink theme and font hooks

AI_PHASE: Phase 3 - first full headless link
AI_STATUS: Blink has explicit AROS control-theme and character-font fallback implementations.
ROOT_CAUSE: AROS selected neither a LayoutTheme::NativeTheme implementation nor the platform FontCache methods required by Blink.
FIX_REASON: Use Blink's default control theme and Skia's active font manager for system-family state and per-character fallback, without importing Linux Fontconfig or reaching below Ozone into display HIDDs.
SCOPE: Blink core layout source selection and platform font cache.
VALIDATION: Filtered GN generation succeeded; both objects and libblink_core/libblink_platform build; nm confirms all four missing methods.
RISK: Native AROS control styling and diskfont family discovery are not yet reflected; fallback quality depends on the configured Skia font manager.
AI_DECISION_CHAIN: ACD-chromium-native-port-roadmap
Continues: ACD-chromium-native-port-roadmap
